            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 19,
              "start": 19
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice Scalia warned against treating beef and mushrooms inconsistently."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Breyer",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "0fa29d4a03ae175b8b37eae634f9972c67b102818af27c8ca90f593c29782374",
